-55f767057617_105853067_1778496544844.mp3" medium="audio" duration="3243" type="audio/mp3" /><pubDate>Thu, 14 May 2026 12:00:00 +0200</pubDate><itunes:duration>3243</itunes:duration><itunes:image href="https://api.ardmediathek.de/image-service/images/urn:ard:image:4fceadab63494aca?w=448&amp;ch=ae9d657737f4409b" /></item></channel></rss>